Library Management System in C

About

A console-based application for managing library books.

Features

- Add new books
- Display available book records
- Search for books by ID
- Issue books
- Return books
- Save and load records using file handling

Technologies Used

- C programming
- Structures
- Functions
- Arrays
- File handling

How to Compile

gcc library_management.c -o library

How to Run

./library

On Windows, run:

library.exe

Learning Objective

To practise modular programming, structures, input validation, and file handling in C.
